<title>USA: US Freightways Corp Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>US Freightways Corp Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>ROSEMONT, Ill. 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997		1996</p>
<p> Revenue			   $355,817,000    $313,705,000</p>
<p> Income from operations (a)    19,071,000	10,412,000</p>
<p> Other expense, net	     (2,319,000)     (2,782,000)</p>
<p> Income before income taxes    16,752,000	 7,630,000</p>
<p> Income tax expense		 7,002,000	 3,281,000</p>
<p> Net income			   9,750,000	 4,349,000</p>
<p> Net income per share		    0.40		0.20</p>
<p> Average shares outstanding    24,591,349	22,159,747</p>
<p>NOTE: (a) After deduction for amortization of intangibles of $653,000 in the first quarter of 1997 and $580,000 in the first quarter of 1996.</p>
<p>Q1 ended March 29 vs March 30.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
